msgstr "- and it''s a solution, not a pass. The set is weighed; what is worth kilobytes for all players is decided on the day when the sortie will need not a stone, but an object. The page is the weighing."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
msgid "— и это сознательно. Работает как выработанная локация: плохая сделка, а не запрет."
msgstr "- and it''s conscious. It works like an elaborate location: a bad deal, not a ban."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
