msgstr "Classes §11.7, and the knight also works as the garrison of the castle (§6.1.6.1). There was also a fourth: a resident of the yard worked as a magician until the tenants were drawn with their own (§ 6.1.10) - an adventurer depicting a citizen, read the yard as a camp of seekers. The rest are measured and waiting: each is worth kilobytes for all players. The page is the weighing on which it was decided, and it also shows what it was worth:"

