msgstr "— the first set that needed the whole picture: tools are made of everything at once — steel heads, tree handles, copper rivets, brass shackles, rope, paper and two paints. Above the atlas, the set has three images-inlays - a map, an empty map and a drawing; they are taken only by models of maps and drawings, and the page reads them by reference from the model itself."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
msgid "— первый такой набор из семи. Треугольники посчитаны по индексам примитивов, габарит — по позициям вершин с учётом трансформов узлов."
