msgstr "The dictionary of the designer and nothing else. On the map of the region appeared the point “Castle”: the building, which walk, without prey and without opponents. Siege machines are not taken any - they contain almost half of the triangles of the set, and there is no siege in the game."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
