msgstr "The phone will pull ten times more. It is about the fact that the model is read on five centimeters of the screen and made in the evening, and therefore refers only to what is drawn with your hands. The opponent has no budget in the triangles: he is taken ready, and the price is in kilobytes."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
msgid "— тем же жестом, каким башня растёт ярусом. Четырёх кнопок «то же самое, но другого цвета» панель не завела."
