msgstr "The panel on top of the camp is not a separate screen: the player does not lose the context of the base and can swipe it down."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: locales/legacy-messages.ts
msgid "Пара занятий — axe 508 + pickaxe 508 = 1016 треугольников, 4.6% набора. Оба легче любой ступени Кайла: инструмент читается силуэтом головы, а не размером."
msgstr "A pair of lessons - Axe 508 + Pickaxe 508 = 1016 triangles, 4.6% of the set.\n"
"Both are easier than any Kyle step: the instrument is read by the silhouette of the head, not the size."

