msgstr "The fourteenth set - and the second after the weapon (§6.1.8), in which no model stands on the ground: the tool is held. The difference with the weapon is who is holding: the weapon is tried on the hero’s fist, the tool lies in the tenant’s hand and speaks for him what he is doing before the player opens the card."

